# Who must review a change, by path (section 5.5). When several patterns match a file, the last
# one wins, so the general rules come first.
#
# The owners are e-mail addresses at ohmline.example, a domain reserved for examples, so that
# nobody real is ever asked for a review. A real repository names GitHub teams instead
# (@your-org/sessions). The two review groups below stand for one reviewer from each team:
#   charging-contracts@  Sessions, Gateway and Finance IT
#   kernel-reviewers@    Sessions, Gateway, Energy, Pricing and Accounts, Finance IT

# Anything not listed below: the architecture group.
*                                           architecture@ohmline.example

# Each context belongs to the team that owns it on the context map.
/src/Charging/                              sessions@ohmline.example
/src/SiteEnergy/                            energy@ohmline.example
/src/Tariffs/                               pricing-accounts@ohmline.example
/src/DriverAccounts/                        pricing-accounts@ohmline.example
/src/Billing/                               finance-it@ohmline.example

# Partnership: the gateway translates straight into Charging's commands, so both teams review.
/src/DeviceGateway/                         gateway@ohmline.example sessions@ohmline.example

# Published Language and Customer/Supplier contracts: the supplier and its consumers review.
/src/Charging/Ohmline.Charging.Contracts/   charging-contracts@ohmline.example
/src/Billing/Ohmline.Billing.Contracts/     finance-it@ohmline.example sessions@ohmline.example

# Shared Kernel: every team that uses it reviews (src/Ohmline.SharedKernel/GOVERNANCE.md).
/src/Ohmline.SharedKernel/                  kernel-reviewers@ohmline.example

# The rules that keep the layout honest, and this file itself.
/build/                                     architecture@ohmline.example
/tests/Ohmline.ArchitectureTests/           architecture@ohmline.example
/docs/context-map.md                        architecture@ohmline.example
/.github/CODEOWNERS                         architecture@ohmline.example
